        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Cairo",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>With a history that spans millennia and home to some of the world's most extraordinary ancient wonders like the Great Pyramid of Giza and the Great Sphinx, Cairo is Egypt's bustling capital. It radiates timeless charm and holds immense cultural, historical, and political significance.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-cairo.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Luxor",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Luxor is renowned for its incredible wealth of ancient Egyptian temples and monuments, essentially making it a living museum. Dubbed the \"world's greatest open-air museum,\" Luxor's historical richness and grandeur continue to awe and inspire visitors globally.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/luxor-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Valley of the Kings",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This ancient necropolis is famous as the final resting place of numerous Egyptian pharaohs, including the legendary Tutankhamun. The discovery of beautifully adorned tombs filled with treasures has long captivated the world's imagination.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Valley_of_the_Kings.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Giza Plateau",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Apart from the pyramids, the Giza Plateau features several remarkable megaliths, notably the Great Sphinx. Researchers have identified signs of water erosion on the bedrock surrounding the Sphinx, suggesting a possible pre-diluvian origin and hinting at an alternative history.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau_2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "bd48c292-e8fb-405b-9fc2-3e92ec363226": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Great Pyramid",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Great Pyramid is an architectural marvel, precisely aligned to Earth's cardinal directions within a fraction of a degree. Although attributed to Pharaoh Khufu (Cheops) of the Old Kingdom, the absence of any remains found inside adds to the enigma surrounding its construction.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_mdGFNt": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Nile River",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Embark on a journey through the heart of Egypt on a cruise ship tour down the Nile River. Enjoy breathtaking vistas of ancient temples, bustling villages, and fertile landscapes. Each day trip is unique, offering new discoveries on this unforgettable odyssey. Experience a guided tour of Egypt—from ancient historical sites to the beauty of the Red Sea—all the while immersing yourself in the rich tapestry of Egyptian history. </p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/nile-capital-cruises_14137_g1_2dd015f1-7c29-4fcd-a770-10bd77c12051.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
      },
