        "cf73ead0-1d61-4710-911f-92abbd89cd91": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Travel Itinerary",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Cairo - Thursday, October 17th",
            "text": "<p>Upon arriving at Cairo Airport, you'll be greeted by a Saba Tours representative and escorted to your hotel. Depending on your arrival time, you can relax and rejuvenate. In the evening, join your fellow travelers for an introductory meeting and a preview of the upcoming adventures.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-1-1200x800.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Arrival at Cairo Airport</li><li>Meet with Saba Tours assistant and transfer to Marriott Mena House Hotel</li><li>Introductory meeting at 6 PM</li><li>Welcome dinner at 7 PM</li><li>Accommodation at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Giza Plateau - Friday, October 18th",
            "text": "<p>Start your day with a private sunrise visit to the Sphinx. Then, embark on a comprehensive tour of the Giza Plateau, exploring the majestic Great Pyramids of Giza and the intriguing Valley Temple. The afternoon includes visits to popular shopping sites in Cairo.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Private sunrise visit to the Sphinx around 6:00 AM</li><li>Return to the hotel for breakfast</li><li>Presentation on the <strong>Lost Technologies of Ancient Egypt</strong> by Mohamed Ibrahim</li><li>Tour of Giza Plateau</li><li>Special guest speaker, <strong>Erich von Däniken</strong></li><li>Lunch at BBQ Mawlana restaurant</li><li>Visit to the Valley Temple</li><li>Visit to the Papyrus Store</li><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "af9886df-0842-456c-a4da-f86a8fae9128": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Cairo/Luxor - Saturday, October 19th",
            "text": "<p>Fly to Luxor and explore the legendary Karnak Temple and its Open-Air Museum, as well as the Chapel of the Seven Gates.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Karnak.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast box </li><li>Morning flight to Luxor</li><li>Visit to Karnak Temple</li><li>Visit to the Open-Air Museum at Karnak</li><li>Visit to the Chapel of Seven Gates</li><li>Special guest speaker, <strong>Erich von Däniken</strong></li><li>Lunch at Al Kersh restaurant</li><li>Transfer to Steigenberger Luxor for check-in</li><li><strong>Presentation on the Star Gates of Ancient Egypt</strong> by Mohamed Ibrahim</li><li>Overnight at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Dendera & Abydos - Sunday, October 20th",
            "text": "<p>Delve into the divine beauty of the Hathor Temple at Dendera, followed by a visit to Abydos Temple and the Osirion Temple.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dendera_Luxor-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Early breakfast</li><li>Drive to Dendera at 6:30AM</li><li>Visit to Hathor Temple</li><li>Drive to Abydos</li><li>Lunch at El Shahat Local House </li><li>Visit to Abydos Temple</li><li><strong>Private visit to the Osirion Temple</strong></li><li>Special guest speaker, <strong>Erich von Däniken</strong></li><li>Drive back to Luxor (4-hour drive)</li><li>Overnight at Steigenberger<br/>Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: West Bank & Nile Cruise - Monday, October 21st",
            "text": "<p>Embark on a Nile cruise, enjoying views of ancient temples, bustling villages, and fertile landscapes. Explore the West Bank of Luxor, including the Valley of the Kings and Hatshepsut Temple.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/nile-capital-cruises_14137_g1.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Check-out from Steigenberger Luxor</li><li>Drive to the West Bank of Luxor</li><li>Visit the Valley of the Kings</li><li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple</li><li>Visit the Alabaster Factory</li><li>Visit the Colossi of Memnon</li><li>Check-in at the Nile Capital Cruise</li><li>Lunch on the M/S Nile Capital</li><li>Dinner on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Overnight on the Nile Cruise</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: Luxor Temple/Sailing - Tuesday, October 22nd",
            "text": "<p>Explore the Valley of the Kings and Luxor Temple. Enjoy sailing to Esna on the Nile Cruise.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WestBank-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Optional hot air balloon ride ($150)</li><li>Breakfast</li><li>Visit to Luxor Temple</li><li>Return to the Nile Cruise</li><li>Lunch on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Sail to Esna</li><li>Dinner on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Overnight on the Nile Cruise</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Edfu-kom Ombo - Wednesday, October 23rd",
            "text": "<p>Visit the ancient temple complexes of Edfu and Kom Ombo along the Nile. Marvel at the Ptolemaic architecture and the unique double design of Kom Ombo Temple.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Edfu_Temple-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Bus to Edfu Temple</li><li>Visit to Edfu Temple</li><li>Return to Nile Cruise</li><li>Sail to Kom Ombo</li><li>Lunch on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Visit to Kom Ombo</li><li>Dinner on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Sail to Aswan</li><li>Overnight on the Nile Cruise</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Aswan - Thursday, October 24th",
            "text": "<p>Discover the Unfinished Obelisk and the majestic temples on Philae Island, including the Isis Temple.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Satet_Temple_1_-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Visit to the Unfinished Obelisk</li><li>Visit to Philae Island and Isis Temple</li><li>Lunch on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Motorboat to Elephantine Island</li><li>Visit to Satet Temple and Khnum Temple</li><li>Return to the Nile Cruise</li><li>Dinner on the Nile Cruise</li><li>Overnight on the Nile Cruise</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "fe9d9b01-84d8-42dd-aa2f-b13bfa9cb5a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 9: Cairo/Egyptian Museum - Friday, October 25th",
            "text": "<p>Fly back to Cairo and tour the Egyptian Museum, exploring artifacts like the Pre-diluvian Jars and the Schist Disc.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cairo_9e35e516-9ce1-474e-be9a-3f0e22556efc.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Transfer to Aswan Airport for flight to Cairo</li><li>Visit to the Egyptian Museum in Cairo</li><li>Lunch at Blue Nile restaurant</li><li>Transfer to the Four Seasons Plaza Hotel</li><li>Check-in at the Four Seasons Plaza</li><li>Overnight at the Four Seasons Plaza</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "61cfa1f6-c4f1-446d-a5ef-2f4486dc1020": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 10: Sakkara / Dahshur - Saturday, October 26th",
            "text": "<p>Explore the Step Pyramid Complex in Sakkara and the Red Pyramid in Dahshur.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sakkara.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Drive to Sakkara</li><li>Visit to Imhotep Museum</li><li>Visit to the Step Pyramid Complex and the southern entrance</li><li>Lunch at Sakkara restaurant</li><li>Drive to Dahshur</li><li>Visit to the Red Pyramid</li><li>Overnight at the Four Seasons Plaza</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "5126e38e-daf5-4953-a36a-6c08bdde1ba3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 11: Old Cairo - Sunday, October 27th",
            "text": "<p>Enjoy an evening visit to the Great Pyramid of Giza, including a private visit inside the Great Pyramid.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dashur-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Free morning</li><li>Optional trip to Old Cairo or the Civilizations Museum</li><li>Farewell dinner at BBQ Mawlana</li><li>Private 2-hour visit inside the Great Pyramid (7-9 PM)</li><li>Overnight at the Four Seasons Plaza</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8e38bacb-2f1f-4c94-b100-a63b49eba045": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 12: Cairo - Monday, October 28th",
            "text": "<p>Bid farewell to Egypt, carrying memories of its ancient wonders.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cairo-01-min.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Departure</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
