    "text_and_image_JPgmwm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MohamehIbrahim_a3ba3b43-ea03-44a4-a2cc-5d8ef4d0a5b4.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Your Local Guides",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3>Mohamed Ibrahim</h3><p>Mohamed Ibrahim is an Egyptologist, hieroglyphics expert, and tour guide driven by his deep passion for ancient Egypt. His quest for answers to questions overlooked by mainstream Egyptology began in his hometown of Memphis, Egypt, surrounded by the enigmatic pyramid complexes of Giza, Saqqara, Dahshur, and Abusir. Ibrahim specializes in legendary star gates, ancient Egyptian healing practices, and energy modalities, with a particular focus on sharing insights into his country's lost technology and civilization.</p><p>In his role as a tour guide, Ibrahim has led numerous tours, consistently exceeding travelers' expectations by meticulously attending to every detail, including exclusive behind-the-scenes access, luxurious accommodations, and exceptional service. He provides an immersive and authentic historical journey that challenges visitors to reconsider their understanding of the world.</p><p>From your arrival in Cairo to your departure, the Saba Tours team ensures an unforgettable exploration of Egypt's ancient mysteries.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_wGD7Qm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/CS4060_Events_Ancient_Civilizations_Conference_2023_headshots_Erich.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Our Special Guest Speaker",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Erich von Däniken</strong></h3><p>For over 50 years, Erich von Däniken has pursued the theory which postulates that Earth might have been visited by extraterrestrials in the remote past. Erich von Däniken, the world's most successful non-fiction writer of all time, has written 45 books and e-media on the topic and has sold over 73 million copies worldwide. His books have been translated into 32 languages. In the United States Erich von Däniken won instant fame as a result of the television special \"In Search of Ancient Astronauts,\" based upon his first book Chariots of the Gods. In addition, Erich von Däniken has participated and contributed in numerous film and TV productions, has written countless articles and compilations. Fluent in four languages, Erich von Däniken is an avid researcher and an energetic traveller, averaging 100'000 miles per year to visit remote places of the Earth. This enables him to closely examine the phenomena about which he writes. His research organization, the A.A.S. R.A. / legendarytimes.com (Archaeology, Astronautics & SETI Research Association), comprises laymen and academics from all walks of life. Internationally, there are about 10,000 members.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_6dhgPK": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-06-03_at_9.42.05_AM.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Supporting Guides",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Ahmed Nady</strong></h3><p>Professional Tour Guide to Egypt since 2003. Over 20 year experience in guiding English speakers from different countries around the globe.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_9Ditee": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-06-03_at_9.41.56_AM.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Hanaa Abd Elkhaleq</strong></h3><p>Graduated from the Faculty of Archaeology at Cairo University, specializing in Egyptian Antiquities. Discovered that working in the field of archaeology is not her passion and would not significantly add to her career growth. Consequently, she pursued a diploma in Tourist Guidance from the Faculty of Tourism and Hotels at Helwan University. She has been working as a tour guide since 2003, gaining extensive experience in the field and thoroughly enjoying the journey.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": true,
