          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "center",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h3>Exclusive Pre-Diluvian Egypt Tour.</h3><p>The Gaia team has hand-curated this one-of-a-kind experience and it's only available through the Gaia Marketplace.</p>"
