    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Exclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>International flights (before and after the tour).</li><li>Visas: Travelers must ensure they have the necessary entry visas for the countries visited. Assistance may be provided at Cairo airport for visa processing, depending on your country of origin.</li><li>Tipping for Saba Tours Team.</li><li>Personal expenses and optional activities.</li><li>Traveler's insurance.</li><li>Laundry services.</li><li>Any additional or optional services/tours not mentioned in the itinerary.</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Reservation and Payment",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>To confirm your booking, full payment is required at the time of booking. Your booking will be considered confirmed only upon receipt of payment.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "88fe273d-dad8-4fcb-8e72-e298aeffea83": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation and Refunds",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Given the complexities of travel coordination, we understand cancellations may occur. All cancellations must be made in writing. Refund details are as follows:</p><ul><li>Before August 15, 2024: Full refund.</li><li>August 16 to August 30, 2024: 50% refund.</li><li>August 31 to September 14, 2024: 25% refund.</li><li>After September 14, 2024: No refund. Please note, no refunds will be provided for unused services voluntarily foregone, such as transfers, city tours, accommodations, meals, or transportation.</li></ul><p>We recommend travelers consider travel insurance to protect against unforeseen changes.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8fef7e85-3dbd-4573-b556-4afbf969813d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Waiver of Responsibility",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By joining the tour, you agree to our Terms, Cancellation and Refunds Policy, and Waiver. While we have made every effort to arrange a smooth journey, Guide of Egypt & Saba Tours are not liable for delays, theft, injury, or other irregularities during the journey. This includes changes to airline schedules, missed connections, additional expenses due to currency fluctuations or itinerary changes, transportation issues, illness, weather conditions, protests, war, terrorism, quarantine, or other causes.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Changes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The itinerary may be adjusted due to unforeseen circumstances such as flight changes. The content will remain largely unchanged and may include pleasant surprises.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We strongly recommend all participants obtain travel insurance covering trip costs, cancellation, interruption, and unforeseen incidents such as illness, injury, or missed connections. Travel Insured International offers comprehensive coverage, including baggage delays, medical expenses, and emergency assistance.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "button_GkTfbb": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "link": "#offer",
            "link_text": "Register Now",
            "link_entitled": "",
            "link_text_entitled": "",
            "align_button": "center"
          }
        }
      },
